Description: A comprehensive statistical and visualization toolkit tailored
    for observational data in fisheries science and aquatic ecology. It
    provides streamlined wrappers for univariate and factorial ANOVA,
    ANCOVA, MANOVA, generalized linear models, non-linear morphometric
    regressions with embedded algebraic equations, ordination techniques
    (NMDS, PCA, RDA, db-RDA, hierarchical clustering), correlation heatmaps,
    integrated Mantel test network linkages, alpha diversity indices,
    species accumulation curves, water quality indices (WAWQI), heavy metal
    ecotoxicological contamination indices, and multi-factor longitudinal
    time-series tracking with uncertainty ribbons. Methodological
    formulations for non-parametric multivariate permutation tests follow
    Anderson (2001) <doi:10.1111/j.1442-9993.2001.01070.pp.x>. Ecological
    community dissimilarity transformations follow Legendre and Gallagher
    (2001) <doi:10.1007/s004420100716>, and ecotoxicological contamination
    index models follow Tomlinson et al. (1980) <doi:10.1007/BF02414780>.
